      "id": "weekly-upstream-20261101",
      "notes": "Add native async throwing apiKeyProvider; resolve a fresh key immediately before every authenticated HTTP send/stream through the shared transport. Preserve static keys, custom header precedence, error/abort propagation, request builders and response parsers. HTTP and access-token requests rotate credentials; WebSocket setup continues using the freshly minted access token rather than exposing the private API key. Reviewed upstream: @ai-sdk/cartesia 3.0.63 to 3.0.67. Validation passed: node Scripts/test-packages.mjs (all 52 owning package suites and the compatibility facade); node Scripts/sdk.mjs generate --check; node --test Scripts/tests/*.test.cjs (27 passed); docs-site check and build (100 pages). Live provider calls were not run.",
      "compatibility": "Minor release for additive native API; existing static settings and call sites remain compatible. Updated direct dependency minimums are recorded in the manifest. Existing documented JS/framework and native product gaps remain; version-delta review does not imply full parity or live-service testing. Explicit custom authentication skips an unused credential supplier, a deliberate native callback-order adaptation."
    }
  ],
